3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be—

(a)to develop the educational, economical, religious,cultural and social needs of the members of ourorganizaion and to the low income familiesincluding the needy people, act in the disastersituations and creating the feeling of positivethinking among the public to achieve the expectedbenefits;

(b)to attend activities on religious development andthe development of the persons;

(c)implementation of activities leading to educationaldevelopment;

(d)to promote values and morals;

(e)to make awareness of Sinhala, English and Sanskritand other languages, computer and technicalknowledge among school children, student monksin Pirivenas and elderly people;

(f)to implement religious and cultural programmes;

(g)to contribute to social welfare;

(h)to implement programmes to assist the disabled andelderly people;

(i)to develop, protect and conservation of our templeand its other associated temples and those monks;

(j)to develop areas that should be developed; and

(k)to perform all other things that are incidental orappropriate for the fulfillment of the objectives ofthe Corporation stated above.

